{"strings":["Declaration","Details related to any statement or action, in any form prescribed or accepted by the Government Agency, giving information or particulars required by the Governmental Agency.","Document acceptance date/time","Date and time of acceptance of a document in accordance with governmental legislation.","Functional identifier","Identification of a specific information exchange.","Document reference number, assigned by the Trader","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document name","Name of the additional document.","Transitional element","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Mode of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying mode of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansModeCodeList","First port of arrival in customs territory date/time","Date and time of arrival (actual or scheduled) of the means of transport at the first port (e.g. seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station).","Transport means direction code","Code specifying the direction of the transport means (i.e., inbound or outbound).","TransportMeansDirectionCodeList","BerthLocation","Details related to the location of berth.","Berth location name","Name of the location in port where the means of transport will berth.","Berth location identifier","Identification of the location in port where the means of transport will berth.","UN/LOCODE + User codes","DutyTaxFee","Details related to calculation of one instance of one duty, one tax, and/or one fee. \nComment: Each instance of this class is to be used for a single occurrence of duty, tax or fee.","Type of duty regime code","Code specifying a type of duty regime.","UN/EDIFACT code list 9213 OR User code list","Payment","Details related to payment details.","Duty/tax/fee reduced assessed amount","Amount of assessed duty, tax or fee due (includes all types of charges and duties) and amount of reduction (if applicable). Assessed per duty, tax or fee type by item and/or declaration.","GoodsShipment","Details related to the movement and the handling of goods shipped together on one or more means of transport between original consignor and final consignee.","Nature of transaction code","Code specifying the nature of a transaction associated with a shipment.","TransactionNatureTypeCodeList","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement amount","Amount expressed on the additional statement.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","International code list (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User code list","Address","Details related to an address.","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","Communication","Details related to communication including number and number type.","Communication identifier","Identification of the communication address.","Communication number type code","Code specifying the type of communication address.","CommunicationMeansTypeCodeList","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","CustomsValuation","Details related to valuation applying to the shipment.","Charges amount","Amount indicating the total cost of freight, insurance and all other costs and expenses from the foreign exit location to the entry location.","Freight costs amount","Amount indicating the total costs incurred by the shipper in moving goods, by whatever means, from one place to another under the terms of the contract of carriage. In addition to transport costs, this may include such elements as packing, documentation, loading, unloading, and insurance (i.e., to the extent that they relate to the freight cost).","Insurance amount","Amount of premium paid/payable to the insurance company for insuring the goods.","DestinationLocation","Details related to the destination location.","Destination country code","Code specifying the country of destination.","ExportCountry","Details related to the export country.","Country of exportation code","Code specifying the country from which the goods are originally exported without any commercial transaction taken place in intermediate countries.","GoodsItem","Details related to the goods item as declared to Government Agency.","Customs amount","Amount declared for customs purposes of those goods in a consignment which are subject to the same customs procedure, and have the same tariff/statistical heading, country information and duty regime.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification type code","Code specifying the commodity classification (e.g. Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS), Export Control Classification Code (ECCC), UNDG Code list, International Code of Zoological Nomenclature).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","DangerousGoods","Details related to the dangerous goods.","United Nations Dangerous Goods (UNDG) identifier","Identification of the unique serial number assigned within the United Nations to substances and articles contained in a list of the dangerous goods most commonly carried.","Hazard class identifier","Identification of the hazard class applicable to dangerous goods as defined by the relevant regulation authority such as the IMDG Class Number of the SOLAS Convention of IMO and the ADR/RID Class Number for the road/rail environment.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Net net weight","Weight of the goods themselves without any packing.","Tariff/supplementary quantity","Quantity specifying the goods in the unit as required by customs for tariff, statistical, fiscal purposes or as indicated in \"type\".","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Goods measure function code","Code specifying the purpose of the measurement.","GoodsMeasureFunctionCodeList","Gross weight","Weight of goods including packing but excluding carrier's equipment.","UCR","Details related to the Unique Trader Reference such as Unique Consignment Reference (UCR).","Trader reference identifier","Identification of the number assigned by a declarant such as a trader reference or a carrier reference."],"root":{"s":"Declaration","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","g":"declaration","w":"42A","u":"0001D","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/Declaration","src":"BIP DEC:4","k":[{"s":"acceptance","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"acceptanceDateTime","x":"AcceptanceDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D048","u":"0001D","q":"2","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/acceptanceDateTime","ub":["upu-cusitm"],"src":"BIP DEC:5"},{"s":"functionalReference","n":4,"d":5,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"functionalReferenceId","x":"FunctionalReferenceID","f":"an..70","r":6,"w":"D026","u":"0001D","q":"7","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/functionalReferenceIdentifier","ub":["mar-api","mar-bri","upu-cusitm","upu-refrsp"],"src":"BIP DEC:10"},{"s":"type","n":7,"d":8,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"typeCode","x":"TypeCode","f":"an..3","w":"D013","u":"0001D","q":"14","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/aipTypeCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/external/un-edifact-code-list-1001-or-user-code-list","ln":9,"ub":["mar-bri","upu-cusitm","upu-refrsp"],"src":"BIP DEC:17"},{"s":"AdditionalDocument","n":10,"d":11,"t":"C","c":"0..*","g":"additi